## Scope and Intent

This source code repository constitutes the personal portfolio, engineering proof-of-work, and digital presentation of Debmalyo Barman. It is made publicly accessible on GitHub solely for demonstration, code inspection, recruiter assessment, and technical review.

## Terms of Use

1. **Permitted Use**:
