2. **Prohibited Use**:
   - **Identity & Case Studies**: You may not duplicate, copy, or redistribute the personal identity, name, biography, contact information, project case studies, or written copy contained within this project.
   - **Design & Layout**: You may not reproduce, clone, or publish the distinctive visual design, architectural drawings, custom SVG schematics, or isometric layout as a live portfolio or website for yourself or any third party.
   - **Commercial Exploitation**: No portion of this proprietary software, design, or written content may be sold, licensed, or used in any commercial service or product.
   - **Public Hosting & Re-distribution**: You may not deploy, host, mirror, or publish duplicate instances of this site on public web servers or cloud providers.

